  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">动态树木</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;| &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/corvus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Corvus</a>&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Harleyoc1/DynamicTreesCorvus/master/dtc-banner.png\" width=\"588\" height=\"240\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>该项目运行于Minecraft 1.12.2的Forge版本，并且在<strong>动态树木</strong>和<strong>Corvus</strong>都更新之前，<strong>不会</strong>更新到更高版本的Minecraft。</p><p>动态树木成功改进了几乎所有原版树木的方面，并且得益于像动态树木 - Biomes O’ Plenty这样的附加组件，你可以在任何包含Biomes O’ Plenty的模组包中享受其升级。</p><p>然而……如果你想使用……每一个模组呢？</p><p>是的，你没听错，有许多模组添加了自己的树木，其中几乎没有一个与动态树木兼容，导致世界中出现不协调的对比。</p><p>我们通过这些模组的目标是覆盖所有与树木有最低相似度的模组，并使其动态化！</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/83qcpkY\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/376864341649129472/732384092401958983/Discord_software-Logo.wine.png?width=1442&amp;height=395\" width=\"234\" height=\"65\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/83qcpkY\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入</a> <strong>动态树木</strong>&nbsp;Discord服务器，获取公告、错误报告、兼容性建议等！&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>树木<br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;• 乳香树</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>世界生成 ✔️<br></strong></span>乳香树在所有热带草原生物群系中生成，取代基础模组中的原版风格树木。</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>所有动态树木附加组件<br></strong></span>&nbsp;•<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dtbop\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;Biomes O’ Plenty</a><br>&nbsp;• <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-heat-and-climate\" rel=\"nofollow\">Heat and Climate</a><br>&nbsp;• <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-traverse\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traverse</a><br>&nbsp;• <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dtphc\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pam’s HarvestCraft</a><br>&nbsp;•&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dttc\" rel=\"nofollow\">Thaumcraft</a><br>&nbsp;•&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-compatibility-for-climatic-biomes\" rel=\"nofollow\">Climatic Biomes<br></a>&nbsp;•&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-roots\" rel=\"nofollow\">Roots</a><br>&nbsp;•&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictreestfc\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraFirmCraft</a><br>&nbsp;•&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-natura\" rel=\"nofollow\">Natura</a><br>&nbsp;•&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-tinkers-construct\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tinker's Construct</a><br>&nbsp;•&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-integrated-dynamics\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrated Dynamics</a><br>&nbsp;•&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-extra-utilities-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extra Utilities</a><br>&nbsp;•&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-thaumic-bases\" rel=\"nofollow\">Thaumic Bases</a><br>&nbsp;•&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-quark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a><br>&nbsp;•&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-tech-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tech Reborn</a><br>&nbsp;•&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-industrial-craft-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Industrial Craft 2</a><br>&nbsp;•&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-sugi-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sugi Forest</a><br>&nbsp;•&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-the-aether-legacy\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether Legacy</a><br>&nbsp;•&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twilight Forest</a><br>&nbsp;•&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-totemic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Totemic</a><br>&nbsp;•&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-forestry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forestry</a><br>&nbsp;• <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-natures-aura\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nature's Aura</a><br>&nbsp;• <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-atum-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Atum 2</a><br>&nbsp;• <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-pams-trees\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pam's Trees</a><br>&nbsp;• <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-forbidden-arcanus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forbidden &amp; Arcanus<br></a>&nbsp;• <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-mystical-world\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mystical World<br></a>&nbsp;• <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-vampirism\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vampirism</a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>依赖项<br></strong></span>以下版本推荐是我测试过并确认可用的版本。它可能在更旧或更新的版本上也能运行，但请注意，这些版本未经测试，可能会导致问题。一如既往，请将你发现的任何问题以及每个依赖项的版本号报告到<a href=\"https://github.com/Harleyoc1/DynamicTreesCorvus/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">问题追踪器</a>。</p><p>&nbsp;•&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.12.2的动态树木</a>&nbsp;[0.9.8+]<br>&nbsp;•&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/corvus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.12.2的Corvus</a>&nbsp;[1.2.3]<br>&nbsp;•&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fmaven%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252findex_1.12.2.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.12.2的Forge</a>&nbsp;[14.23.5.2838+]</p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">模组包使用</span><br></strong>欢迎在任何模组包中使用此模组，无需请求许可。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>评论已禁用，请使用<a href=\"https://github.com/Harleyoc1/DynamicTreesCorvus/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">问题追踪器</a>&nbsp;或<a href=\"https://discord.gg/83qcpkY\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>服务器讨论该项目。&nbsp;</p>",
